<title>GERMANY: German Dec wholesale prices up 0.3 pct m/m.</title>
<headline>German Dec wholesale prices up 0.3 pct m/m.</headline>
<dateline>WIESBADEN, Germany 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Statistics Office reported the following economic indicator:</p>
<p> GERMAN WHOLESALE PRICES	Dec 96	Nov 96	 Dec 95</p>
<p> Monthly change		    +0.3	   -0.6	   +0.2</p>
<p> Yearly change		     +0.5	   +0.4	   -0.6</p>
<p> Index (basis 1991)	     102.7	  102.4	  102.2</p>
<p>NOTE - The wholesale price index averaged 103.1 over 1996 as a whole, down 0.6 percent from 103.7 in 1995.</p>
<p>-- Bonn newsroom, +49 228 26097150</p>
</text>
